+# Davide Compatibility Patch
+
+Personal compatibility patch for selected X4 Foundations mods.
+
+This patch requires the original mods and does not redistribute their assets or full files.
+
+## Scope
+
+Included:
+
+- `fab_slaves_tradeware`: targeted compatibility for coherent penal colony builders and DeadAir-style economy management.
+
+Not included:
+
+- GalNet/GNN. It is Davide's own mod and remains in its own extension.
+- DeadAir files. DeadAir is not redistributed or patched directly here; the bridge only checks DeadAir runtime data if it exists.
+- Pure Italian localization files. Keep those in a separate language patch if needed.
+- Full files, assets, scripts, or text packs from third-party authors.
+
+## Requirements
+
+Required:
+
+- `fab_slaves_tradeware`
+
+Optional runtime compatibility:
+
+- DeadAir Eco / DeadAir Scripts No DA Wares, if installed.
+
+## What It Patches
+
+### fab_slaves_tradeware
+
+- Extends the penal colony production module selection to coherent factions only:
+  - Scaleplate / SCA
+  - VIG / loanshark
+  - Yaki
+  - Buccaneers / BUC
+  - Fallensplit
+  - Split / Zyarth
+  - Freesplit / FRF
+- Keeps civilized factions excluded.
+- Keeps `ware.slaves` illegal/sensitive and not universal.
+- Adds a low-frequency backstop so only a few penal colonies can appear.
+- Adds a guarded DeadAir GOD quota bridge for `ware.slaves` when DeadAir runtime tables are present.
+
+## What It Does Not Patch
+
+- No Jobs quotas.
+- No GalNet/GNN files.
+- No Dynamic War files.
+- No `x4native.lua`.
+- No C++ or DLL files.
+- No original mod assets.
+- No full third-party XML or MD file redistribution.
+
+## Installation
+
+Place this folder in:
+
+`B:\SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\X4 Foundations\extensions\davide_compat_patch`
+
+Keep the original required mods installed as separate extensions.
+
+## Credits
+
+Original mods remain the work of their respective authors.
+
+- `fab_slaves_tradeware`: original extension required by this patch.
+- ChillHeadHunter / Head Hunter: Chillmatica.
+- GettingPaid: iforgotmysocks.
+- TaterTrade: Ludsoe and DeadAir.
+- Casino and Gambling Den - Passive Income: Gylis.
+
+This compatibility patch is intended for a personal compatibility/modpack setup and should be reviewed before public redistribution.

