+# Davide Compatibility Patch Notes
+
+## 001 - 2026-04-28
+
+- Added compatibility support for `fab_slaves_tradeware`.
+- Allows the penal colony production module to be selected by coherent criminal and Split-aligned factions only.
+- Adds module ownership for Fallensplit, VIG/loanshark, Yaki and Buccaneers without making `ware.slaves` universal.
+- Adds a small runtime backstop for low penal colony counts.
+- Adds a guarded DeadAir GOD quota bridge that activates only when DeadAir's runtime table exists.
+
+No GalNet/GNN files, Jobs files, Dynamic War files, native DLLs, assets, or third-party full-file overrides are included.

