+# Compatibility Analysis
+
+Date: 2026-04-28
+
+## Content IDs
+
+- `fab_slaves_tradeware`: Sklaven Handelsware, author OpenAI.
+- `casino_and_gambling_den_passive_income`: Casino and Gambling Den - Passive Income, author Gylis.
+- `ws_2992233767`: Head Hunter / ChillHeadHunter, author Chillmatica.
+- `GettingPaid`: GettingPaid, author iforgotmysocks.
+- `TaterTrade`: TaterTrade, author Ludsoe and DeadAir.
+- `GalNet`: Galaxy News Network, author Askeladd. Excluded because it is Davide's own mod.
+- `DeadAir_Eco` and `DeadAir_Scripts`: excluded from direct patching.
+
+## Converted
+
+### fab_slaves_tradeware
+
+Classification: compatibility.
+
+Converted into this patch:
+
+- Module selection for coherent penal colony builders.
+- Module ownership for optional coherent factions.
+- Low-frequency penal colony backstop.
+- Guarded DeadAir GOD quota bridge.
+
+Not converted because already present in the available baseline copy of `fab_slaves_tradeware`:
+
+- `ware.slaves` definition.
+- coherent trade-station buyers.
+- moderate sink script.
+- optional faction guards in trade/sink scripts.
+
+## Not Converted
+
+### ChillHeadHunter
+
+Classification: no functional local delta found.
+
+Compared against `B:\X4 mod\chillheadhunter`. Only line-ending/trailing newline differences were detected in MD files, so no compatibility patch was created.
+
+### GettingPaid
+
+Classification: localization.
+
+Compared against `B:\X4 mod\gettingpaid`. The only detected local delta is `t\0001-L039.xml`, an Italian localization file. It is intentionally excluded from this compatibility patch.
+
+### TaterTrade
+
+Classification: no local delta found.
+
+Compared against `B:\X4 mod\tatertrader`. No file differences were detected, so no patch was created.
+
+### Casino and Gambling Den - Passive Income
+
+Classification: no safe local baseline found.
+
+The installed extension contains functional MD and Italian text, but no clean local baseline was found for comparison. No compatibility patch was created.
+
+### STARS / asset packs
+
+Classification: invasive asset/catalog delta.
+
+Large asset and catalog differences were detected against a local reference tree. These are not suitable for this lightweight compatibility patch.

